# A local device answering (§5.4.5, Clauses 15–16). Records run in order
# against one database, so a write and the reads after it are a story:
# device 599 "Lift gateway", vendor 260; analog-input 1 "Car 1 load", 420.0
# kg, read-only; analog-output 1 "Fan speed", commandable, relinquishing to
# 0.0; analog-value 1 "Setpoint", 21.5, writable.

# Discovery: I-Am to every Who-Is that includes 599, broadcast; I-Have by
# name and by identifier; silence for what is not here.
10 08 => broadcast 10 00 c4 02 00 02 57 22 05 c4 91 03 22 01 04
10 08 09 00 19 0a => none
10 08 0a 02 57 1a 02 57 => broadcast 10 00 c4 02 00 02 57 22 05 c4 91 03 22 01 04
10 07 3d 0b 00 43 61 72 20 31 20 6c 6f 61 64 => broadcast 10 01 c4 02 00 02 57 c4 00 00 00 01 75 0b 00 43 61 72 20 31 20 6c 6f 61 64
10 07 2c 00 40 00 01 => broadcast 10 01 c4 02 00 02 57 c4 00 40 00 01 75 0a 00 46 61 6e 20 73 70 65 65 64
10 07 3d 04 00 4e 6f 70 => none

